Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.57,0:00:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wealth, Fame, Power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.85,0:00:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,obtained this and everything\Nelse the world had to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.81,0:00:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,His dying words drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.31,0:00:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.01,0:00:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything I gathered\Ntogether in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.09,0:00:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuits
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.27,0:00:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forward and bring us along,\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.87,0:00:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,together we will find a greeting\Nthat we're looking for, one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.37,0:00:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The hump is left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.09,0:00:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.95,0:00:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.73,0:00:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.73,0:01:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.31,0:01:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.43,0:01:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Till someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.19,0:01:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through all the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.95,0:01:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And through the heartache.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.65,0:01:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.69,0:01:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that I will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.59,0:01:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,To stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.09,0:01:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.35,0:01:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So come forward and pray along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.43,0:01:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.29,0:01:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That we will explore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.49,0:01:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There is silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.79,0:01:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.05,0:01:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.05,0:01:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.33,0:01:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We are on the cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.81,0:02:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Praise Alabasta!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.05,0:02:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.35,0:02:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care on your voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.97,0:02:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Didi-chan looked like she was\Nhaving a fine time, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.05,0:02:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have been feeling\Nlike a pirate again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.51,0:02:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when I thought she'd started\Nto act like a real princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.77,0:02:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is Head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now proceed to escort the\NNefertari safely to Mary Jo's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.81,0:02:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.21,0:02:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please get down from there at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.69,0:02:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The ocean breeze feels so wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.61,0:02:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.93,0:02:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What if a monstrous bird were to sweep\Ndown from the sky and abduct you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.53,0:03:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What if there were a sniper\Nlurking in wait to take your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What if a meteor fell from the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi traveled\Nwith pirates, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.31,0:03:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There are marines\Nstanding right next to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.63,0:03:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You worry too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Cough. Cough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.27,0:03:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do not strain\Nyourself, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.09,0:03:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are feeling unwell,\Nwe can turn back at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I am alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.07,0:03:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since that day when I met Nico Robin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.15,0:03:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had some questions that I would\Nlike to ask of the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.91,0:03:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this about the poneglyphs?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.69,0:03:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Too many enemies in the way of my dream.\NI must attend this reverie no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.31,0:03:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And if fate will allow it I would\Nvery much like to know what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.83,0:03:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That the king of the house of\NNefertari did to the world long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma! Ma! Ma! Ma! Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, will you stop\Nthis madness, Princess Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.15,0:04:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, how are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I have certainly felt better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.85,0:04:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I do not have much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If only my daughter\Nwere to take a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.73,0:04:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We have received a veritable\Nmountain of photographs from suitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.95,0:04:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn them all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.93,0:04:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your recent\Ncoronation, your majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.01,0:04:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We hope you find\Neverything to your liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This hotel was built for the\Nsole use of royal personages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.13,0:04:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,on their journey to the\Nreverie once every four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.09,0:04:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not, not, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:04:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.91,0:05:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it is fairly ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.77,0:05:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This view of Gold Roger's execution\Nplatform is charming enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.91,0:05:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then have a wonderful stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We hope you rest well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.61,0:05:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Be gone from my sight, you\Nirritating pieces of trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,King Stella!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.23,0:05:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In countries the world over,\Nthere are stirrings afoot,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.89,0:05:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,for an event held only once\Nevery four years approaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.67,0:05:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,An event held at the center of\Nthe world in Marijua itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The Reverie, a council of kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,At this, the greatest of all councils,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.03,0:05:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the rulers of fifty\Nkingdoms gather in one place
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.07,0:05:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,to discuss and debate\Nmatters of global importance,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and decide upon their\Nplans for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.95,0:05:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But when these bunning and\Noff-centric rulers come face-to-face,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,matters never seen to proceed\Nas smoothly as one may hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:06:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The war is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.03,0:06:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and Tang Chin Jiao, that is to\Nsay, Tang Sai, has yet to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.59,0:06:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that we will miss Reverie,\Nand we have many matters to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.01,0:06:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.23,0:06:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Scar Kingdom, don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.89,0:06:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, how best to put that buffoon\NDalton in his place? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that unappreciated face for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.77,0:06:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying I'll join you\Nas your ship's doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're happy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.21,0:06:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I can come?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.93,0:06:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be my attendant, how about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Viola-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this sounds exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.87,0:07:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I already turned down\Nmy battleship escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, why don't we travel\Nto the Holy Land together?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.11,0:07:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, do you think this\Nis some kind of holiday?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.59,0:07:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.99,0:07:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy-sama made a promise to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.37,0:07:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He promised that when we meet again,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.59,0:07:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,he would take me to the\Nreal forest on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.99,0:07:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't doubt Luffy-kun\Nwill take you anywhere you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.27,0:07:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But this isn't a long journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.87,0:07:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We are only traveling to\NMary Joy, directly above.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.77,0:07:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, shall we not just let\NShirahoshi sit this one out, Merde?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.23,0:07:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she doesn't need to go in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.65,0:08:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We have plenty of signatures for our\Npetition to re-locate Fishman Island. Mambo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,To leave her behind will\Nnot be allowed to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.81,0:08:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,that we do not trust the\Nhumans or want them to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.45,0:08:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi, what did the\NStar Hat Pirates teach you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This council is our chance to\Nfulfill our mother Otohime's wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.01,0:08:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.95,0:08:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A little of a starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.77,0:08:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, put a\Nlittle more effort into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to sink us? Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.37,0:08:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't leapt off from\Nthe top of Zoe like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.99,0:08:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't be all so\Nrattled, idiot. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.79,0:08:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I am reflecting on how\Nwonderful it is to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.89,0:08:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.31,0:08:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:08:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're really on the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:09:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This big, heavy boat is\Njust floating along! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.51,0:09:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing on the board?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.01,0:09:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot! Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.43,0:09:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot? Why are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided to come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.67,0:09:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Gar! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.53,0:09:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.44,0:09:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.99,0:09:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.53,0:09:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we'll just have\Nto turn this ship around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.25,0:09:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't turn back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanda will be really angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.49,0:09:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to go on\Nan adventure for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.67,0:09:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.23,0:09:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.43,0:09:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.77,0:09:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.75,0:09:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I've brought lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Some juice, a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.53,0:09:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare clothes, and.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.27,0:09:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The ocean really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a land at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.09,0:09:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the opposite of land.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.63,0:09:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been on a sleepover before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.81,0:10:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.79,0:10:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, thank you. I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.67,0:10:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you eating my carrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.43,0:10:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Pat her head, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.21,0:10:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.43,0:10:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy almost got killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.95,0:10:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, she's used to a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.29,0:10:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get all the\Nway up there, Pedro-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.27,0:10:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody make food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.85,0:10:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, you're all hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.53,0:10:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go make something\Nto keep watch, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll cost you 5,000 pennies each.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.53,0:10:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.75,0:10:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's like all of my allowance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.59,0:10:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you suggesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:10:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a pretty big headline.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.47,0:10:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.01,0:11:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A location shrouded in mystery\Nfor decades is finally discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.37,0:11:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Baltigo, headquarters of the\NRevolutionary Army, lies in ruins.
